                    <i data-lucide="layers" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Structural Characteristics &amp; 17 Materials
                </h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                    <div><span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">PROPERTY TYPE (USE)</span><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">@Dash(bldg?.BuildingUseType) @(!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(bldg?.OtherBuildingUseType) ? $"({bldg.OtherBuildingUseType})" : "")</strong></div>
